<title>USA: Bankers Trust Minnesota deal Aaa/VMIG-1 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust Minnesota deal Aaa/VMIG-1 by Moody's.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, April 10 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating</p>
<p>Announcement As of 04/04/97.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Trust Receipts Bankers Trust ser.</p>
<p>BTP-211 class A ctfs. (rel. to 5.25% State of Minnesota General Obligation State Various Purpose Bonds due 11-1-12)</p>
<p>    State		 : MN</p>
<p>    Rating		: Aaa/VMIG 1</p>
